#. type: TH
#: minios-live.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MINIOS-LIVE"
msgstr "MINIOS-LIVE"

#. type: TH
#: minios-live.1:3 minios-cmd.1:3 condinapt.1:3 condinapt-minios.7:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "September 2026"
msgstr "September 2026"

#. type: TH
#: minios-live.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS Live System Builder"
msgstr "Pembuat Sistem MiniOS Live"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:4 minios-cmd.1:4 condinapt.1:4 condinapt-minios.7:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAMA"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:6
msgid "minios-live - build MiniOS ISO images in ordered stages"
msgstr "minios-live - membangun citra ISO MiniOS dalam tahapan berurutan"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:6 minios-cmd.1:6 condinapt.1:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SINOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:9
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] [\\f[B]-h\\f[R] | \\f[B]--help\\f[R]] [\\f[I]start-"
"command\\f[R]] [\\f[B]-\\f[R]] [\\f[I]end-command\\f[R]]\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] [\\f[B]-h\\f[R] | \\f[B]--help\\f[R]] [\\f[I]start-"
"command\\f[R]] [\\f[B]-\\f[R]] [\\f[I]end-command\\f[R]]\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:9 minios-cmd.1:8 condinapt.1:10 condinapt-minios.7:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESKRIPSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:14
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] builds a MiniOS live system as an ordered sequence "
"of stages.  It creates a base system, layered SquashFS modules, boot files, "
"configuration data, and the final ISO.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] membangun sistem live MiniOS sebagai rangkaian "
"tahapan yang terurut. Program ini membuat sistem dasar, modul SquashFS "
"bertingkat, berkas boot, data konfigurasi, dan ISO akhir.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:27
msgid ""
"The default \\f[B]build.conf\\f[R] currently lists Debian "
"\\f[B]buster\\f[R], \\f[B]bullseye\\f[R], \\f[B]bookworm\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]trixie\\f[R]; Ubuntu \\f[B]bionic\\f[R], \\f[B]focal\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]jammy\\f[R], \\f[B]noble\\f[R], and \\f[B]resolute\\f[R]; and Devuan "
"\\f[B]beowulf\\f[R], \\f[B]chimaera\\f[R], \\f[B]daedalus\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]excalibur\\f[R].  It lists \\f[B]amd64\\f[R], \\f[B]i386\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R] architectures; \\f[B]core\\f[R], \\f[B]flux\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]xfce\\f[R], and \\f[B]lxqt\\f[R] environments; \\f[B]minimum\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]standard\\f[R], \\f[B]toolbox\\f[R], and \\f[B]ultra\\f[R] variants; "
"and \\f[B]xz\\f[R], \\f[B]lzo\\f[R], \\f[B]gz\\f[R], \\f[B]lz4\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]zstd\\f[R] compression.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]build.conf\\f[R] bawaan saat ini mencantumkan Debian "
"\\f[B]buster\\f[R], \\f[B]bullseye\\f[R], \\f[B]bookworm\\f[R], dan "
"\\f[B]trixie\\f[R]; Ubuntu \\f[B]bionic\\f[R], \\f[B]focal\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]jammy\\f[R], \\f[B]noble\\f[R], dan \\f[B]resolute\\f[R]; serta Devuan "
"\\f[B]beowulf\\f[R], \\f[B]chimaera\\f[R], \\f[B]daedalus\\f[R], dan "
"\\f[B]excalibur\\f[R]. File ini juga mencantumkan arsitektur "
"\\f[B]amd64\\f[R], \\f[B]i386\\f[R], dan \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R]; lingkungan "
"\\f[B]core\\f[R], \\f[B]flux\\f[R], \\f[B]xfce\\f[R], dan \\f[B]lxqt\\f[R]; "
"varian \\f[B]minimum\\f[R], \\f[B]standard\\f[R], \\f[B]toolbox\\f[R], dan "
"\\f[B]ultra\\f[R]; serta kompresi \\f[B]xz\\f[R], \\f[B]lzo\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]gz\\f[R], \\f[B]lz4\\f[R], dan \\f[B]zstd\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:31
msgid ""
"Not every combination is necessarily available.  The installed "
"configuration, selected environment, and configured repositories determine "
"what can be built."
msgstr ""
"Tidak semua kombinasi pasti tersedia. Konfigurasi yang terpasang, lingkungan "
"yang dipilih, dan repositori yang dikonfigurasi menentukan apa yang dapat "
"dibangun."

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:31 minios-cmd.1:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "REQUIREMENTS"
msgstr "PERSYARATAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:34
msgid "Build stages require root.  Help does not."
msgstr "Tahapan build membutuhkan akses root. Bantuan tidak membutuhkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:42
msgid ""
"A source-tree build requires a Debian or Ubuntu host and the packages listed "
"in \\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\f[R].  Repository access must be "
"available directly or through the configured cache.  The default "
"configuration enables apt-cacher-ng at \\f[B]127.0.0.1:3142\\f[R]; run that "
"service or set \\f[B]USE_APT_CACHER=false\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Build dari source-tree memerlukan host Debian atau Ubuntu dan paket-paket "
"yang tercantum pada \\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\f[R]. Akses ke "
"repositori harus tersedia secara langsung atau melalui cache yang "
"dikonfigurasi. Konfigurasi bawaan mengaktifkan apt-cacher-ng di "
"\\f[B]127.0.0.1:3142\\f[R]; jalankan layanan tersebut atau setel "
"\\f[B]USE_APT_CACHER=false\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:45
msgid ""
"Do not run internal scripts from the \\f[B]linux-live\\f[R] directory "
"directly.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Jangan jalankan skrip internal langsung dari direktori \\f[B]linux-"
"live\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:50
msgid ""
"The current bootstrap uses \\f[B]debootstrap \\[en]no-check-gpg\\f[R] and "
"retrieves some repository keys over unauthenticated HTTP.  Independently "
"verify build inputs before treating a locally built image as a trusted "
"release artifact.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Bootstrap saat ini menggunakan \\f[B]debootstrap \\[en]no-check-gpg\\f[R] "
"dan mengambil beberapa kunci repositori melalui HTTP tanpa autentikasi. "
"Verifikasi input build secara mandiri sebelum memperlakukan citra hasil "
"build lokal sebagai artefak rilis yang tepercaya.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "COMMANDS"
msgstr "PERINTAH"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:53
msgid ""
"Commands run in the following order.  Hyphens and underscores are "
"interchangeable in command names."
msgstr ""
"Perintah dijalankan dalam urutan berikut. Tanda hubung dan garis bawah dapat "
"dipertukarkan dalam nama perintah."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-bootstrap\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-bootstrap\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:57
msgid ""
"Recreate the selected target\\[cq]s \\f[B]core\\f[R] and \\f[B]image\\f[R] "
"trees, then create or restore the minimal root filesystem.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Buat ulang pohon \\f[B]core\\f[R] dan \\f[B]image\\f[R] target yang dipilih, "
"lalu buat atau pulihkan filesystem root minimal.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-chroot\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-chroot\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:60
msgid "Install and configure core system components in the chroot."
msgstr "Instal dan konfigurasikan komponen inti sistem di dalam chroot."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-live\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-live\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:63
msgid "Create the core SquashFS image."
msgstr "Buat citra inti SquashFS."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-modules\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-modules\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:66
msgid "Build additional SquashFS modules."
msgstr "Bangun modul tambahan SquashFS."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-boot\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-boot\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:69
msgid "Generate boot files, initrd, and boot-loader configuration."
msgstr "Hasilkan berkas boot, initrd, dan konfigurasi boot-loader."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-config\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-config\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:72
msgid "Generate live-system configuration data."
msgstr "Hasilkan data konfigurasi live-system."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]build-iso\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]build-iso\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:75
msgid "Create the final ISO from prepared build data."
msgstr "Buat ISO akhir dari data build yang telah disiapkan."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]remove-sources\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]remove-sources\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:80
msgid ""
"If \\f[B]REMOVE_SOURCES=true\\f[R], delete and recreate the complete "
"selected work directory.  Otherwise this stage does nothing.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Jika \\f[B]REMOVE_SOURCES=true\\f[R], hapus dan buat ulang seluruh direktori "
"kerja yang dipilih. Jika tidak, tahap ini tidak melakukan apa-apa.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "RANGE SELECTION"
msgstr "PEMILIHAN RENTANG"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:82
msgid "No arguments, \\f[B]-h\\f[R], or \\f[B]--help\\f[R] display help.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Tanpa argumen, \\f[B]-h\\f[R], atau \\f[B]--help\\f[R] akan menampilkan "
"bantuan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:88
msgid ""
"A single command runs only that stage.  \\f[B]start-command - end-"
"command\\f[R] runs an inclusive range.  \\f[B]- end-command\\f[R] starts at "
"the first stage.  \\f[B]start-command -\\f[R] continues through the final "
"stage.  A lone \\f[B]-\\f[R] runs every stage.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Satu perintah hanya menjalankan tahap tersebut. \\f[B]start-command - end-"
"command\\f[R] menjalankan rentang inklusif. \\f[B]- end-command\\f[R] mulai "
"dari tahap pertama. \\f[B]start-command -\\f[R] melanjutkan hingga tahap "
"terakhir. \\f[B]-\\f[R] saja menjalankan semua tahap.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:88 minios-cmd.1:155 condinapt.1:272
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "CONTOH"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:90
msgid "Run the complete build:"
msgstr "Jalankan build lengkap:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-live -\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-live -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:96
msgid "Run from the first stage through chroot installation:"
msgstr "Jalankan dari tahap pertama hingga instalasi chroot:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-live - build-chroot\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-live - build-chroot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:102
msgid "Rebuild boot and configuration data:"
msgstr "Bangun ulang data boot dan konfigurasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-live build-boot - build-config\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-live build-boot - build-config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:108
msgid "Create an ISO from prepared data:"
msgstr "Buat ISO dari data yang telah disiapkan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-live build-iso\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-live build-iso\n"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "KONFIGURASI"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:119
msgid ""
"A source checkout reads \\f[B]linux-live/build.conf\\f[R] by default and "
"uses \\f[B]build/\\f[R] below the checkout.  An installed copy reads \\f[B]/"
"etc/minios-live/build.conf\\f[R] and uses \\f[B]build/\\f[R] below the "
"current directory.  Set \\f[B]BUILD_CONF\\f[R] and \\f[B]BUILD_DIR\\f[R] to "
"override those defaults.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Checkout source akan membaca \\f[B]linux-live/build.conf\\f[R] secara "
"default dan menggunakan \\f[B]build/\\f[R] di bawah checkout. Salinan "
"terpasang akan membaca \\f[B]/etc/minios-live/build.conf\\f[R] dan "
"menggunakan \\f[B]build/\\f[R] di bawah direktori saat ini. Setel "
"\\f[B]BUILD_CONF\\f[R] dan \\f[B]BUILD_DIR\\f[R] untuk mengganti nilai "
"default tersebut.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:121
msgid "Configuration files are sourced as Bash and must be trusted."
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi dieksekusi sebagai Bash dan harus dipercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:125
msgid ""
"Additional software is selected in module \\f[B]packages.list\\f[R] files.  "
"Modules are linked into the selected environment under \\f[B]linux-live/"
"environments/\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Perangkat lunak tambahan dipilih dalam berkas modul "
"\\f[B]packages.list\\f[R]. Modul-modul tersebut dihubungkan ke lingkungan "
"yang dipilih di bawah \\f[B]linux-live/environments/\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:132
msgid ""
"\\f[B]build-modules\\f[R] skips modules whose SquashFS artifacts already "
"exist.  After changing a module, remove its artifact from the selected work "
"directory\\[cq]s \\f[B]image/\\f[R] tree before rebuilding.  The builder "
"then invalidates the following module chain; kernel module rebuilding is "
"handled separately.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]build-modules\\f[R] melewati modul yang artefak SquashFS-nya sudah "
"ada. Setelah mengubah modul, hapus artefaknya dari pohon \\f[B]image/\\f[R] "
"di direktori kerja yang dipilih sebelum membangun ulang. Builder kemudian "
"menginvalasi rantai modul berikutnya; pembangunan ulang modul kernel "
"ditangani secara terpisah.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:132 condinapt.1:266 condinapt-minios.7:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "FILES"
msgstr "BERKAS"

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:133 condinapt-minios.7:218
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]linux-live/build.conf\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]linux-live/build.conf\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:136
msgid "Default configuration in a source checkout."
msgstr "Konfigurasi bawaan pada checkout source."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:136 condinapt-minios.7:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]/etc/minios-live/build.conf\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]/etc/minios-live/build.conf\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:139
msgid "Default configuration for an installed copy."
msgstr "Konfigurasi bawaan untuk salinan terpasang."

#. type: TP
#: minios-live.1:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:142
msgid "Host packages required for a source-tree build."
msgstr "Paket host yang diperlukan untuk build source-tree."

